{"parse":{"title":"特性/银狼穿心2","pageid":7297,"revid":17414,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E9%93%B6%E7%8B%BC%E7%A9%BF%E5%BF%832&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E9%93%B6%E7%8B%BC%E7%A9%BF%E5%BF%832&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E9%93%B6%E7%8B%BC%E7%A9%BF%E5%BF%832&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>银狼穿心2</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.93.B6.E7.8B.BC.E7.A9.BF.E5.BF.832\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"银狼穿心2\"><b>银狼穿心2</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 冰原狼王.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/59/tppkulafgl1ih1aujd4vgt06gho12ky.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E7%8B%BC%E7%8E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/59/tppkulafgl1ih1aujd4vgt06gho12ky.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E7%8B%BC%E7%8E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/59/tppkulafgl1ih1aujd4vgt06gho12ky.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />银狼穿心2\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦战斗开始时获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"狼血觉醒1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">狼血觉醒1</font></span></span>]。免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形效果。<br />✦攻击后，目标每拥有1层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伤口\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">伤口</font></span></span>]，对其附加攻击者生命值<font color=\"#ed7950\">7%</font>的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，每回合最多发动<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>次。<br />✦受到环境伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">90%</font>；受到百分比伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">80%</font>。<br />拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"自然守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">自然守护</font></span></span>]，效果：<br />✦受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">90%</font>；<br />✦最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。<br />✦每次造成物理伤害后，施加1层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"伤口\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">伤口</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦受到<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次持续伤害（同时触发算1次），行动结束时，受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"守护失效\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">守护失效</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%93%B6%E7%8B%BC%E6%88%98%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/银狼战士\"><img alt=\"银狼战士 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/41q7wlah6f66gwr21u51utvvzwpn1ni.png/75px-%E9%93%B6%E7%8B%BC%E6%88%98%E5%A3%AB_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f1/41q7wlah6f66gwr21u51utvvzwpn1ni.png/113px-%E9%93%B6%E7%8B%BC%E6%88%98%E5%A3%AB_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f1/41q7wlah6f66gwr21u51utvvzwpn1ni.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164200\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.100 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.139 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 932/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17928/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4938/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  120.548      1 模板:特性\n100.00%  120.548      1 -total\n 69.77%   84.103      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 64.24%   77.442      8 模板:中括号介绍\n  8.63%   10.400      1 模板:面包屑\n  5.02%    6.048      1 模板:魔物图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:7297-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 202610221